00:41:02,360 --> 00:41:03,640
<font color="#ffffff">I'm a true fan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

681
00:41:03,720 --> 00:41:05,800
<font color="#ffffff">You're incredible!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

682
00:41:05,880 --> 00:41:09,000
<font color="#ffffff">Knowing someone</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">has got your back through this,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

683
