702
00:41:54,120 --> 00:41:55,280
<font color="#ffffff">I promise you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

703
00:41:55,360 --> 00:41:57,400
<font color="#ffffff">I won't let anything happen to me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

704
00:41:57,480 --> 00:42:00,120
<font color="#ffffff">until I bring down the person</font><font color="#ffffff">
