724
00:43:02,640 --> 00:43:04,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm done running away.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

725
00:43:04,640 --> 00:43:06,960
<font color="#ffffff">Petch, I'm begging you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

726
00:43:07,040 --> 00:43:09,240
<font color="#ffffff">Trust me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

727
00:43:09,320 --> 00:43:12,440
