00:43:15,360 --> 00:43:16,600
<font color="#ffffff">What plan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

730
00:43:16,680 --> 00:43:17,920
<font color="#ffffff">Never mind that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

