00:44:04,800 --> 00:44:06,200
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't kill that woman.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

751
00:44:07,400 --> 00:44:08,680
<font color="#ffffff">I was set up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

752
00:44:14,360 --> 00:44:15,920
<font color="#ffffff">You can fool anyone else,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

753
00:44:16,000 --> 00:44:18,160
<font color="#ffffff">but not my daughter!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

754
00:44:19,760 --> 00:44:21,680
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not fooling her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

755
00:44:22,240 --> 00:44:24,960
<font color="#ffffff">I would never do something like that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

756
00:44:25,760 --> 00:44:28,320
<font color="#ffffff">You were in a juvenile training center</font><font color="#ffffff">
