760
00:44:36,280 --> 00:44:38,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'm calling the cops to lock you up!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

761
00:44:38,160 --> 00:44:39,160
<font color="#ffffff">Dad!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

762
00:44:39,240 --> 00:44:41,760
<font color="#ffffff">-Please don't do this!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Stay out of this!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

763
00:44:44,520 --> 00:44:46,000
<font color="#ffffff">Dao.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

764
00:44:46,080 --> 00:44:47,000
<font color="#ffffff">Dao.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

765
00:44:51,040 --> 00:44:52,280
<font color="#ffffff">It was just a dream.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

766
00:44:59,600 --> 00:45:01,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm so sorry, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

767
00:45:01,640 --> 00:45:05,040
<font color="#ffffff">I was waiting for you in the car,</font><font color="#ffffff">
