00:45:10,200 --> 00:45:11,960
<font color="#ffffff">but please care about yourself too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

771
00:45:13,840 --> 00:45:15,920
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

772
00:45:16,600 --> 00:45:18,360
<font color="#ffffff">But if Mom never fully recovers,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

773
00:45:18,960 --> 00:45:21,360
<font color="#ffffff">would there ever be a day</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you stop worrying?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

774
00:45:23,320 --> 00:45:25,120
<font color="#ffffff">Talking back at your old man, huh?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

775
00:45:25,200 --> 00:45:26,440
<font color="#ffffff">That's not what I meant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

776
00:45:26,520 --> 00:45:28,040
<font color="#ffffff">I'm just saying</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

777
00:45:28,120 --> 00:45:30,280
<font color="#ffffff">the way I worry about Petch</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

778
00:45:30,360 --> 00:45:33,800
<font color="#ffffff">is no different from the way</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you worry about Mom.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

779
00:45:34,560 --> 00:45:36,000
<font color="#ffffff">Okay, I understand now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

780
00:45:36,520 --> 00:45:37,560
<font color="#ffffff">Dad!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

781
00:45:39,120 --> 00:45:41,440
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you want to ask me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">anything about Petch?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

782
00:45:43,120 --> 00:45:45,840
<font color="#ffffff">Talk later. Let's go make merit first.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

783
00:46:10,240 --> 00:46:11,080
<font color="#ffffff">This is for you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

784
00:46:12,600 --> 00:46:14,520
<font color="#ffffff">I wanted to cheer you up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

785
00:46:15,560 --> 00:46:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">Take it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

786
00:46:16,880 --> 00:46:18,840
<font color="#ffffff">I put a lot of effort into this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

787
00:46:23,400 --> 00:46:24,600
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you, Dao.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

788
00:46:26,040 --> 00:46:28,400
<font color="#ffffff">I really do feel better now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

789
00:46:29,080 --> 00:46:30,160
<font color="#ffffff">Sweetheart.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

790
00:46:31,000 --> 00:46:32,200
<font color="#ffffff">Yes?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

791
00:46:32,280 --> 00:46:33,320
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

792
00:46:34,960 --> 00:46:37,800
<font color="#ffffff">I saw you spacing out.</font><font color="#ffffff">
