793
00:46:37,880 --> 00:46:40,480
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, just thinking about the old days.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

794
00:46:40,560 --> 00:46:41,520
<font color="#ffffff">It's nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

795
00:46:42,600 --> 00:46:44,440
<font color="#ffffff">Then let's go pray.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

796
00:46:44,520 --> 00:46:45,960
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

797
00:46:51,000 --> 00:46:53,760
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I pay my highest respects to the Buddha.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

798
00:46:53,840 --> 00:46:57,200
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Please grant your divine protection</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>to keep Petch safe,</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

799
00:46:57,280 --> 00:46:59,640
<font color="#ffffff"><i>and may he be cleared</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
