800
00:47:46,600 --> 00:47:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">DAWN MEMORIAL PAVILION, EST 1985</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

801
00:47:49,080 --> 00:47:50,200
<font color="#ffffff">Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

802
00:47:51,440 --> 00:47:52,560
<font color="#ffffff">Here is your coffee.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

803
00:47:52,640 --> 00:47:53,600
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

804
00:47:54,240 --> 00:47:55,440
<font color="#ffffff">What about you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

805
00:47:56,320 --> 00:47:57,840
<font color="#ffffff">I won't have anything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

806
00:47:58,360 --> 00:48:00,960
<font color="#ffffff">Just being here</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">has brought me enough peace of mind.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

807
00:48:02,120 --> 00:48:03,120
<font color="#ffffff">Good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

808
00:48:03,200 --> 00:48:06,560
<font color="#ffffff">I wanted you to let go of your worries</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

809
00:48:06,640 --> 00:48:08,120
<font color="#ffffff">so you could feel better.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

810
00:48:08,960 --> 00:48:12,960
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for bringing me here today.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

811
00:48:13,040 --> 00:48:15,240
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, no need to thank me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

812
00:48:15,320 --> 00:48:18,480
<font color="#ffffff">Seeing you at peace</font><font color="#ffffff">
