00:48:31,640 --> 00:48:32,880
<font color="#ffffff">About Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

816
00:48:33,840 --> 00:48:36,120
<font color="#ffffff">Ever since the news broke,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

817
00:48:36,200 --> 00:48:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">you haven't asked me a single question.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

818
00:48:42,360 --> 00:48:45,120
<font color="#ffffff">If you think Petch is a murderer,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

819
00:48:45,200 --> 00:48:47,280
<font color="#ffffff">you can just tell me straight out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

820
00:48:48,720 --> 00:48:49,880
<font color="#ffffff">You've overthought it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

821
00:48:50,680 --> 00:48:52,800
<font color="#ffffff">I haven't said a word.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

822
00:48:55,360 --> 00:48:59,000
<font color="#ffffff">I saw how furious Mr. Sompob was.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

823
00:48:59,080 --> 00:49:01,000
<font color="#ffffff">So I assumed you would--</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

824
00:49:01,080 --> 00:49:02,760
<font color="#ffffff">I would think like Sompob?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

825
00:49:04,080 --> 00:49:05,960
<font color="#ffffff">Why would I ever think that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

826
00:49:07,560 --> 00:49:09,120
<font color="#ffffff">Does that mean</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

827
00:49:09,840 --> 00:49:12,760
<font color="#ffffff">you actually believe Petch is innocent?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

828
00:49:12,840 --> 00:49:15,160
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't just meet him yesterday.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

829
00:49:15,760 --> 00:49:19,640
<font color="#ffffff">Back when your mother and I</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">were entirely against him<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

830
00:49:19,720 --> 00:49:22,160
<font color="#ffffff">until the day she was hospitalized,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

831
00:49:22,240 --> 00:49:24,920
<font color="#ffffff">he still took the time</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to come and play music for her<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

832
00:49:25,000 --> 00:49:27,680
<font color="#ffffff">without holding a grudge.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

833
00:49:28,280 --> 00:49:29,400
<font color="#ffffff">And above all,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

834
00:49:30,240 --> 00:49:31,920
<font color="#ffffff">I know a man like Petch</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

835
00:49:32,000 --> 00:49:34,960
<font color="#ffffff">would never harm a woman like that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

836
00:49:36,280 --> 00:49:37,560
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

837
00:49:38,120 --> 00:49:41,640
<font color="#ffffff">I'm so glad</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you didn't just believe the rumors.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

838
00:49:43,400 --> 00:49:45,240
<font color="#ffffff">But there is one thing bothering me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

839
00:49:45,760 --> 00:49:49,800
<font color="#ffffff">I can't help but wonder how his wallet</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">ended up at the crime scene.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

840
00:49:51,560 --> 00:49:53,800
<font color="#ffffff">Someone deliberately framed him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

841
00:49:54,960 --> 00:49:56,040
<font color="#ffffff">Are you sure?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

842
00:49:56,800 --> 00:49:58,120
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

843
00:49:58,200 --> 00:50:02,160
<font color="#ffffff">The whole thing was orchestrated</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to make Petch the prime suspect.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

844
00:50:03,560 --> 00:50:04,920
<font color="#ffffff">Does that mean</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

845
00:50:05,000 --> 00:50:07,800
<font color="#ffffff">you know who did it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

846
00:50:09,600 --> 00:50:11,960
<font color="#ffffff">I need a little more time</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to find evidence.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

847
00:50:12,040 --> 00:50:13,760
<font color="#ffffff">It won't be long</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

848
00:50:13,840 --> 00:50:15,840
<font color="#ffffff">until we find the real culprit.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

849
00:50:21,320 --> 00:50:24,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'll get them to confess everything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

850
00:50:24,080 --> 00:50:25,920
<font color="#ffffff">You've already done so much for me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

